sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as Auth service
    participant M as Mail service
    U->>W: Request password reset (email)
    W->>A: Find account by email
    alt account exists
        A->>M: Send reset link
        M-->>U: Email with reset link
        opt account has 2FA enabled
            A->>U: Ask for 2FA code
            U->>A: 2FA code
        end
        W-->>U: "Check your inbox"
    else no account
        W-->>U: "Check your inbox"
    end
    loop until the password is accepted, at most 3 attempts
        U->>W: Submit new password
        W->>A: Validate password policy
        A-->>W: Result
    end
